# 涂板菌落计数实验 CFU（AsterML v2）

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-cfu
schema: 1
title: 梯度稀释涂板菌落计数（CFU/mL）
objective: 通过 10 倍系列稀释与琼脂涂板，在 30-300 CFU 有效计数区间内计算原液活菌浓度。
experimental_unit: 90 mm 涂布平皿
primary_endpoint: 活菌浓度 CFU/mL
endpoint_method: 30-300 菌落数平皿涂布法
endpoint_unit: CFU/mL
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-cfu
schema: 1
title: 菌落计数样本与稀释组
rows:
  - id: g-stock
    name: 原液样本组 (10^-3 ~ 10^-5)
    role: treatment
    condition: S. aureus 对数期菌悬液
    replicate_count: 3
  - id: g-neg
    name: 无菌稀释液阴性对照
    role: control
    condition: 无菌生理盐水空涂板
    replicate_count: 2
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-cfu
schema: 1
title: 涂板菌落计数
endpoint: viable_count
unit: CFU/mL
group_refs: [g-stock, g-neg]
timepoints: [24h]
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: dish-cfu
schema: 1
format: 24
topology: dish
rows: 2
columns: 4
assay: assay-cfu
groups:
  g-neg: [A1, A2]
  g-stock: [B1, B2, B3, B4]
roles:
  A1: blank
  A2: blank
  B1: sample
  B2: sample
  B3: sample
  B4: sample
samples:
  A1: DIL-BLANK-1
  A2: DIL-BLANK-2
  B1: CFU-10e-4-1
  B2: CFU-10e-4-2
  B3: CFU-10e-5-1
  B4: CFU-10e-5-2
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-01-serial-dil
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 01 10倍梯度系列稀释
assay: assay-cfu
timepoints: [24h]
path: cfu/01-serial-dilution
order: 1
blocks:
  - kind: calculator
    id: blk-cfu-serial
    schema: 1
    title: 10 倍系列稀释梯度计算（10^-1 ~ 10^-6）
    mode: serial_dilution
    dilution_factor: 10
    steps_count: 6
    stock: {value: 100000000, unit: CFU/mL}
    volume_per_unit: {value: 1, unit: mL}
  - kind: subflow
    id: blk-cfu-subflow
    schema: 1
    title: 每级稀释规范子步骤（混匀与更换枪头）
    collapsed: false
    items:
      - id: sf-pre
        title: 每支离心管预先分装 900 uL 无菌 PBS
      - id: sf-transfer
        title: 移取 100 uL 上级菌液加入下一管并涡旋混匀 10 s
      - id: sf-tip
        title: 每次转移更换新无菌吸头防止交叉带菌
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-02-plate-incubate
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 02 吸取 0.1 mL 涂布与 37 Cel 恒温培养
assay: assay-cfu
timepoints: [24h]
path: cfu/02-plate-incubate
order: 2
blocks:
  - kind: param_table
    id: blk-cfu-params
    schema: 1
    title: 涂布与培养条件
    rows:
      - key: plated_ml
        label: 单皿涂布体积
        value: 0.1
        unit: mL
      - key: temp
        label: 培养温度
        value: 37
        unit: Cel
  - kind: timer
    id: blk-cfu-timer
    schema: 1
    title: 37 Cel 菌落形成培养
    mode: countdown
    duration: {value: 24, unit: h}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-03-count
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 03 30-300 有效区间判定与 CFU/mL 换算
assay: assay-cfu
timepoints: [24h]
path: cfu/03-count
order: 3
blocks:
  - kind: checklist
    id: blk-cfu-rule
    schema: 1
    title: 菌落计数规则核查
    items:
      - id: chk-blank
        label: 阴性对照平板无可见菌落（0 CFU）
        blocking: true
      - id: chk-range
        label: 选用菌落数在 30-300 CFU 的稀释梯度进行换算
        blocking: true
        allow_rule_skip: true
        skip_rule: 若所有稀释度均超出 30-300 区间则按 TNTC/TFTC 记录并重测
  - kind: data_table
    id: blk-cfu-table
    schema: 1
    title: 平皿菌落计数与原液浓度计算表
    schema_id: cfu_plate_count
    endpoint: viable_count
    columns:
      - key: well
        label: 平皿/样本
        value_kind: text
      - key: colonies
        label: 菌落数
        value_kind: number
        unit: CFU
        min: 30
        max: 300
      - key: dilution
        label: 稀释系数
        value_kind: number
        unit: 1
      - key: plated_ml
        label: 涂布体积
        value_kind: number
        unit: mL
      - key: cfu_ml
        label: 原液浓度的算术值
        value_kind: formula
        formula: "colonies / (dilution * plated_ml)"
        unit: CFU/mL
    rows:
      - well: B1
        colonies: 142
        dilution: 0.0001
        plated_ml: 0.1
      - well: B2
        colonies: 158
        dilution: 0.0001
        plated_ml: 0.1
      - well: B3
        colonies: 16
        dilution: 0.00001
        plated_ml: 0.1
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-cfu
schema: 1
steps: [step-01-serial-dil, step-02-plate-incubate, step-03-count]
edges:
  - from: step-01-serial-dil
    to: step-02-plate-incubate
  - from: step-02-plate-incubate
    to: step-03-count
```
